</groundspeak:text></groundspeak:log><groundspeak:log id="1256879090"><groundspeak:date>2024-08-24T19:19:05</groundspeak:date><groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type><groundspeak:finder id="453288">go-purdue</groundspeak:finder><groundspeak:text encoded="false">I’m caching in your area today with zugzwang.  We made the drive over here from Indy.  Just a few caches and a trip to Jungle Jim’s.  

