Brownsburg, Indiana </groundspeak:text></groundspeak:log><groundspeak:log id="1251075881"><groundspeak:date>2024-08-04T15:02:52</groundspeak:date><groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type><groundspeak:finder id="6646077">ArSoNOpTiKS</groundspeak:finder><groundspeak:text encoded="false">Once we found our way in, it was a fast find. The cache is in bad shape but its there. That is one heck of a sycamore, that's for sure. Thanks for placing a large, they are hard to come by. TFTC. </groundspeak:text></groundspeak:log></groundspeak:logs></groundspeak:cache></wpt></gpx>